l last):\r\n  File \"C:\\Users\\User\\mcp-servers\\mes-log-mcp\\tests\\check_cuore_log.py\", line 199, in <module>\r\n    entry = catalog.CATALOG.by_name(\"SCAN_2610131952.txt\")\r\n  File \"C:\\Users\\User\\mcp-servers\\mes-log-mcp\\mes\\catalog.py\", line 328, in by_name\r\n    path = paths.resolve_log(name)\r\n  File \"C:\\Users\\User\\mcp-servers\\mes-log-mcp\\mes\\paths.py\", line 154, in resolve_log\r\n    raise MesNotFound(f\"no log named {name!r} in any configured root: {searched}\")\r\nmes.errors.MesNotFound: no log named 'SCAN_2610131952.txt' in any configured root: C:\\Users\\User\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\cuore-check-cuore-log-mes-jji8_ubh","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"f6273862-b153-44f1-aeb9-af156131b6b4","timestamp":"2026-10-14T11:07:57.936Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"=== setup ===\r\n  [ok] real observation lines were found and copied\r\n  [ok] mes.cuore_log can reach cuore.live.scanlog\r\n=== cuore_list_scans / cuore_latest_scan ===\r\n  [ok] the real session's scans are returned\r\n  [ok] every scan carries a kind\r\n  [ok] newest-first order\r\n  [ok] server.cuore_list_scans matches the library call\r\n  [ok] latest_scan is the newest of list_scans\r\n  [ok] kind filter narrows to attempts only\r\n=== cuore_read_scan ===\r\n  [ok] read_scan found the scan\r\n  [ok] the P0440 freeze frame is present\r\n  [ok] the freeze frame carries the engine_rpm PID\r\n  [ok] Mode 06 MID 3A is present\r\n  [ok] Mode 06 MID 3A FAILed\r\n  [ok] health_verdict line is present when scan_health_bridge is importable\r\n  [ok] an unknown scan id returns None\r\n=== cuore_search ===\r\n  [ok] U1713 has at least one hit\r\n  [ok] one hit is the module_dtcs line, with context\r\n  [ok] a kinds filter that excludes observations finds nothing\r\n  [ok] server.cuore_search matches the library call\r\n=== logs_timeline ===\r\n  [ok] the MES scan is in the merged timeline\r\n  [ok] the CUORE session is in the merged timeline\r\n  [ok] the merged timeline is newest first\r\n  [ok] 